  - Conversion failure → USER_CHECKPOINT (retry · accept source-only · abort)

USER_CHECKPOINT — export PDF to documentation folder and sync · save PDF under operations docs and return link · skip PDF export.

**Squad Leader responsibility (binding):** Only the Squad Leader initiates this
gate. Children do not offer PDF export as their primary completion path.
**Forbidden:** auto-PDF after each part; embedding Drive conversion transport in
